		"en": [
			"~ “SD Gundam World Heroes THE LEGEND OF DRAGON KNIGHT” has started! ～",
			"A new story following “SD Gundam World Heroes” has started! After bikes and horses, there are dragons! ? A new item that can be ridden by a wide range of characters!",
